/P 69 0 R
/T (Algorithms \(DSA\) project. It allows users to view available buses, search buses by destination, book tickets, cancel tickets, sort buses by fare and view the waiting queue. The project uses an ArrayList to maintain bus and booking records, a Queue to manage passengers waiting for a full bus, searching to locate buses and tickets, and sorting to arrange buses by fare. File handling is used to load bus information from buses.txt when the program starts and save updated seat availability when the user exits.)
/E (Algorithms \(DSA\) project. It allows users to view available buses, search buses by destination, book tickets, cancel tickets, sort buses by fare and view the waiting queue. The project uses an ArrayList to maintain bus and booking records, a Queue to manage passengers waiting for a full bus, searching to locate buses and tickets, and sorting to arrange buses by fare. File handling is used to load bus information from buses.txt when the program starts and save updated seat availability when the user exits.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
