/T (The sample data contains two buses: B101 from Raipur to Bhopal with a fare of Rs. 700 and two seats, and B102 from Raipur to Nagpur with a fare of Rs. 450 and two seats. The first generated ticket ID is TKT101. The project demonstrates how basic DSA concepts can be combined to solve a practical reservation problem through a simple menu-driven interface.)
