/T (The application starts by reading bus records from a text file. The menu then allows the user to view buses, search by destination, book a ticket, cancel a ticket, sort buses by fare or inspect the waiting queue. When a ticket is booked, the available seat count decreases. When a ticket is cancelled, the seat count increases and the waiting queue is checked for a passenger who can now be accommodated.)
