/Title (The application starts by reading bus records from a text file. The menu then allows the user to view buses, search by destination, book a ticket, cancel a ticket, sort buses by fare or inspect the waiting queue. When a ticket is booked, the available seat count decreases. When a ticket is cancelled, the seat count increases and the waiting queue is checked for a passenger who can now be accommodated.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 624 0 R
/Prev 737 0 R
/Next 755 0 R
>>
endobj
