<<
/Title (The project is designed for learning and demonstration. It uses in-memory collections during execution and a text file for bus data persistence. It does not include online payment, user accounts, database connectivity or a graphical interface.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 624 0 R
/Prev 754 0 R
/Next 738 0 R
>>
endobj
756 0 obj
<<
/Title (Develop a console-based bus reservation application. Users should be able to search buses by destination, book and cancel tickets, and sort buses by fare. If a bus is full, a passenger should be placed in a waiting queue and receive a seat when a ticket is cancelled. Bus information must be loaded from a file at startup and saved on exit.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 738 0 R
>>
